  "body": "## What changed\n- Centered the `40 x 40 x 8` box stock on `pos (0, 0, 0)` (keeping the quarter-turn rotation on `rotated = true`) in `crates/app/tests/trochoid_law.rs`, `crates/app/tests/circular_pick_law.rs`, and `crates/app/tests/circular_entity_law.rs`.\n- Added stock-bounds assertions inside `job()` and dedicated pinning tests (`fixture_stock_covers_the_part_in_both_cases` and `fixture_stock_covers_the_part`) verifying `stock_world_aabb_for` equals `[-20, 20]^2 x [0, 8]`.\n- Updated `trochoid_law::a_whole_model_trochoid_through_the_pocket_wall_gouges_and_never_posts` to pass `by_op = rotated` to `assert_post_refused` because the centered aligned stock lets the program simulator detect the wall gouge first.\n- Recorded the design decision in `docs/decisions/1608-trochoid-fixture-stock.md`.\n\n## Cause\n`SetStock` places a `StockShape::Box` centered on `Location.pos`, so the previous `(-20, -20, 0)` and `(20, -20, 0)` positions placed the aligned stock on `[-40, 0]^2` and the rotated stock on `[0, 40] x [-40, 0]`, covering only one quadrant of the `[-20, 20]^2` part.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins added: `trochoid_law::fixture_stock_covers_the_part_in_both_cases`, `circular_pick_law::fixture_stock_covers_the_part_in_both_cases`, `circular_entity_law::fixture_stock_covers_the_part`.\n- All three pins failed on `upstream/main` (`0db66c4`) with stock at `(-40, -40, 0)..(0, 0, 8)`.\n- Mutation checks: restoring `job()` from `upstream/main` in each of the three files made its corresponding pin fail; restoring the fix made each pin pass.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`circular_entity_law`, `circular_pick_law`, `trochoid_law` all green in 37s).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed cleanly.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\nFull release gate (`cargo xtask gate release`); test-only fixture change checked with `gate quick` and `clippy --all-targets`.\n\n## Overlaps\nNone.\n\nChangelog: Center fixture stock over the part in `trochoid_law`, `circular_pick_law`, and `circular_entity_law`\nFixes #1608\n",
